venv/
output/
examples/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.git/
.github/
.DS_Store

# Local secrets never belong in an image (app/dev_env.py would also skip them inside one).
**/.env
**/node_modules
portal/dist

# Local data, databases, logs, backups and notes never belong in an image: `COPY api api` would otherwise carry a
# developer's own api/aksor_khmer_bi.db (users, password hashes) and api/logs into something that gets published.
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.log
**/logs
data
backups
data.before-restore-*
specs
**/.env.*
.claude
.idea
.vscode
tmp

# The patterns above without a leading **/ only match at the top of the build context; these catch the same
# leftovers inside api/, packages/ and portal/ (a developer's api/.pytest_cache and __pycache__ were being copied
# into the image, with their test names and Python-version-specific bytecode).
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/.DS_Store
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/.venv
